      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 33,
          "start": 1514,
          "end": 1549
        }
      ],
      "text": "I join the Court's opinion in full."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.28,
      "end": 8.8,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 33,
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1670
        }
      ],
      "text": "The Court's opinion sets a “high bar” for the miscarriage-of-justice exception to render an appeal waiver unenforceable."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.8,
      "end": 19.14,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 33,
          "start": 1685,
          "end": 1689
        },
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 52,
          "end": 224
        }
      ],
      "text": "The Court describes the exception as applying in “extreme cases” to sentencing errors that are “egregious” and “obvious” and that “undermine public confidence in the judiciary.”"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.14,
      "end": 22.32,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 243,
          "end": 297
        }
      ],
      "text": "I appreciate Justice Gorsuch's thoughtful concurrence."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.32,
      "end": 26.98,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 298,
          "end": 389
        }
      ],
      "text": "But I respectfully disagree with his understanding of the miscarriage-of-justice exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.98,
      "end": 34.3,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 390,
          "end": 520
        }
      ],
      "text": "As I read it, his concurring opinion would set a lower bar for the miscarriage-of-justice exception than the Court's opinion does."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.3,
      "end": 39.58,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 521,
          "end": 616
        }
      ],
      "text": "In my view, therefore, the concurrence may not be entirely consistent with the Court's opinion."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.58,
      "end": 42.64,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "ranges": [
        {
          "page": 34,
          "start": 617,
          "end": 679
        }
      ],
      "text": "In any event, the Court's opinion of course speaks for itself."
    }
  ],
